    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University Hospital commissioned its 200th laboratory specimen collection unit on December 10, 2012. The opening of the collection unit is part of ongoing efforts by the Hospital to provide quality testing services throughout the country which has already seen the opening of a stat lab in Rawalpindi in September and the setting up of Pakistan's first fully automated biochemistry laboratory in February this year.",
